      "text" : "Whoa..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 26,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "You've actually been to Valhalla?! Wow, you've come a long way..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 29,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Chief Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 30,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Hmmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 31,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "It seems that you're not ready to become a Merchant again. Go finish learning the Basic Novice Skills first."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 33,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Chief Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 34,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Don't worry, we'll always have a Merchant position open for you. Just come back when you're ready, okay?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 37,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Chief Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 38,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "I guess it's destiny that we meet like this once more. Alright. Once again, let me change you into a Merchant!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 45,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Chief Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 46,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Ah~ How nostalgic. Just like old times! Alright, do your best!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 49,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Chief Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 50,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "^333333*Sigh*^000000"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 51,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "I'm so bored..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 52,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "When will I hear from my lovely Blossom?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 56,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 57,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Hey, why are you here?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "I want to be a merchant."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "I want to know more about merchants."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Ask him the requirements to be a merchant."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "option",
      "line" : 59,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Nothing."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 61,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 64,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : ".....? Sorry? What are you saying?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 65,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "You are already a merchant. Oh my.."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 66,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Huh?! ...Do I need to laugh right now?!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 68,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Ahh? Are you trying to have both ways?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 69,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "How about just giving yourself over to your original job?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 71,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 72,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "We have business ethics you know."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 76,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Want to be a merchant? Hmm..."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 79,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 80,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "But if you want to be a merchant, your basic skill level must reach Level 9 or you must spend all of your skill points."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 82,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 83,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Don't you think we need to learn some basic skills although we just deal with money?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 86,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 87,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Good, I think you're fully ready for it seeing that your basic skill level is fulfilled."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 88,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Now I allow you to be a merchant."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 90,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 91,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Congratulations on becoming a merchant!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 92,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Congratulations again for being a member of the merchant guild and one of our colleagues. I expect your active participation from now on!"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 96,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 97,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Absolutely, we need young people who have passion to achieve our great goal for securing 20% of the worldwide currency volume. You get it? Huh?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 98,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Well, I'm just saying... it means let's make lots of money in the end. You guys know that~"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 102,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 103,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Merchant? To put it simply, the person who sells good and makes money is a merchant."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 104,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Not good at fighting and doesn't have special attack/recovery skills... but a merchant can buy things at a low price and then sell them and make money."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 106,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 107,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Well, a merchant has an ultimate skill called Mammonite which strikes an enemy with his/her money... We can equip everything except Bows, Rods, and Two-Handed Swords. But we can always sell and buy those."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 108,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Yes... we merchants always have money on our minds, got it?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 111,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 112,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "To become a merchant, although just selling and receiving money is our job, you must reach at least basic skill level 9."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 114,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 115,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Well, we used to receive a start-up fee before. Wasn't it hard to make that money?"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 116,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "There were too many people who couldn't gather that money and kept crying."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 118,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "[Guildsman Mahnsoo]"
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 119,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "So recently, we decided to allow any Novice who wants to be a merchant become one."
    },
    {
      "kind" : "message",
      "line" : 120,
      "npc" : "Merchant",
      "text" : "Because to be alive or not later is all up to one's ability."
    }
  ]
}